  {
    "uid": "0h4ftc4gkcaq0doc761ot15b7g@google.com",
    "title": "IBRA New Officials Clinic",
    "kind": "Other",
    "start": "2015-03-07",
    "end": "2015-03-07",
    "days": 1,
    "location": "Des Moines, IA - Location TBD based on # of Participants",
    "city": "Des Moines, IA",
    "description": "Well, it is that time of year again, a call out to those who have an interest in working as an USA Cycling Official. We have clinics every year, in some cases participants come to the class, hang out for a year or two and work some races and find it is not for them, others find a passion for the role and excel. Every person who takes the class learns something about the sport they did not know previously. It is a great foundation as a Race Director, as a racer, and as an official.\n\nThis class will satisfy 2 different functions:\n\n1- We will be training new Officials who will earn a C Level Officials License\n2- Race Directors will receive 2 Continuing Education Credits for attending the class\n\nSo why would you want to be a race official, and what role do they serve?  The official helps Race Directors manage their event, the official helps riders have a fair and safe race, the official helps compile results, the official gets to see some of the best views of the tactics of bike racing, and the official performs a variety of tasks on race day and in preparation for a race that assists all stakeholders in having a successful event.\n\nWE NEED YOU:\n\nThe Iowa Bicycle Racing Association New Officials Clinic\nDate: Saturday March 7th\nTime: 9:00 a.m.\nLocation: Des Moines Metro (Location still being determined)\nInstructor: Jeff Mertz\nClass Timeline:\n9:00 - 2:00 Class instruction\n2:00-3:00 Test (Open Book)\n3:00-3:30 New Rules Clinic\nLunch: Lunch will be provided by IBRA\nClass Fee for Officials: The $35 is paid for by IBRA and covers your first year race official’s license.\nClass Fee for Race Directors: the Cost is free, pass the test and you earn your race Director CEU Credits.\n\nRSVP: Please respond/confirm to Jeff Mertz at jeffvmertz@gmail.com by Wednesday March 4th\n\nThanks, and please spread the word!",
    "permit": "",
    "website": "",
    "registration": "",
    "cancelled": false,
    "year": 2015,
    "path": "/races/2015/ibra-new-officials-clinic/"
  },
